# Redirects — read natively by Cloudflare Pages.
#
# IMPORTANT: Cloudflare Pages serves "clean" URLs (/about, /contact, …) natively
# and automatically redirects /page.html → /page. Because of that, you must NOT
# add rules like "/about  /about.html" — combined with the automatic .html→clean
# redirect they create an INFINITE redirect loop (this broke about/contact/privacy/
# terms/digitech/sitemap). Only list alias slugs whose name differs from the page
# they point to, and point them at the clean URL.

/home           /             301
/practices      /outsourcing  301
/for-practices  /outsourcing  301
/business       /industry     301
/for-business   /industry     301
